# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Maestro Builder — local environment template.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in real values.
# .env.local is gitignored so your real keys never leave the machine.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Mailjet — single-sender-verified ESP. Free tier: 200 sends/day, 6000/month.
# Setup:
#   1) Create a free account at https://app.mailjet.com (no credit card)
#   2) Senders & Domains → Add a sender → enter your email → confirm via the
#      link Mailjet emails you (this verifies the SENDER, no DNS needed)
#   3) Account Settings → API Key Management → copy the API Key + Secret Key
#   4) Paste the key + secret below, set MAILJET_FROM_ADDRESS to whatever
#      address you verified in step 2, then restart the dev server.
MAILJET_API_KEY=
MAILJET_API_SECRET=

# REQUIRED — must match a sender you've verified inside Mailjet's dashboard.
MAILJET_FROM_ADDRESS=
MAILJET_FROM_NAME=Maestro Builder
